ting athletes with daily needs.. Requirements: Required Qualifications: Responsible, hard working, reliable. Preferred Qualifications: Leadership qualities, ability to complete tasks on your own. Additional Information: Worcester State University is an Affirmative Action/Equal Opportunity Employer which seeks to reflect the diversity of its community. *This position is available for WSU students only* Hourly Rate: $15.00 Application Instructions: Students must apply online. *This position is for WSU students only.* Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs) Powered by Hide Main Navigation Worcester State University 486 Chandler St, Worcester, MA 01602"
